B.a5_=new A.be("Late period","A late bleed","Stress, travel, illness, and pregnancy can move a date. This is education, not a test.")
B.a4X=new A.be("Discharge","Discharge colors","Creamy, watery, and egg-white are log words. Color alone is not an infection and not ovulation.")
B.a4B=new A.be("Pleasure","Pleasure stays a note","Desire can be logged. EVA does not give sexual instructions.")
B.a4k=new A.be("Ovulation","How long the window is","The estimate is about six days, ending on the estimated ovulation day. It is not contraception.")
B.a4F=new A.be("Perimenopause","When cycles change","Cycles can shorten, lengthen, or skip. EVA will not call yours normal or abnormal from one date.")
B.a50=new A.be("Sleep","No sleep score","Hours are not stored here, so there is no score and no automatic tracking badge.")
